Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["FIG 4g", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.986900050889435*^9, 
  3.9869000598825893`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"42cde7be-b09e-054f-b634-\
e0fdaa62e3fa"],

Cell["\<\
In this figure, the data imported are the numbers of tips by generation. A \
normalization function is defined to rescale generations and convert tip \
numbers to probabilities.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9869020053998775`*^9, 3.9869020383440914`*^9}, {
  3.986902235380808*^9, 3.986902245543001*^9}, {3.986902276294939*^9, 
