Cell["\<\
For counting the number of branches at a given order, merging was performed \
as per the Strahler definition.
However, for calculating mean branch lengths, merging was not performed.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.988881448232889*^9, 
  3.9888815302335815`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"8084970d-d049-404d-8642-\
