   RowBox[{"w", ">", "2"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "5e2bbe03-f542-a049-8360-7ff0880273e7"],
 " were included, as the lumen in younger branches was not fully developed \
and its diameter could not be accurately estimated."
}], "Text",
